solution_steps:
First, let's draw a diagram of the square ABCD and point P inside it.

[asy]
unitsize(0.2cm);
pair A, B, C, D, P, G1, G2, G3, G4;

A = (0,0);
B = (30,0);
C = (30,30);
D = (0,30);
P = (15,18);

G1 = centroid(A, B, P);
G2 = centroid(B, C, P);
G3 = centroid(C, D, P);
G4 = centroid(D, A, P);

draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);
draw(A--P--B);
draw(B--P--C);
draw(C--P--D);
draw(D--P--A);

